 celebre giornalista sua connazionale (che ha l'età per essere sua madre), poi facendosi un nome all'interno della comunità diplomatica di Washington D.C. Ulrich e Elsa abitano in una bella brownstone nel cuore del quartiere chic Georgetown, con grande disappunto della figlia della donna, Amanda, docente di Diritto costituzionale all'Università di Harvard in rotta con il \"patrigno\" suo coetaneo.","tagline":"Tutti gli hanno creduto, tutti sono stati ingannati."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Ulrich Mott  is an eccentric and versatile social climber with grandiose plans to affect United States foreign policy. Encouraged  in his attempts by his strategically chosen (and much older) wife, the well-connected journalist Elsa Brecht, Mott has a knack for making himself indispensable and impossible to ignore. The only one seemingly immune to his charms is Elsa's daughter Amanda, who might simply disapprove of her mother marrying a much younger man - or perhaps she senses something more sinister beneath the smooth-talking surface?"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lbq6pu9oWamT8xRNjItS87uE2DZ.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lbq6pu9oWamT8xRNjItS87uE2DZ.png","language":"en","width":4295,"height":325},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s8eMxEQWh7xT6Geh6i3QFX811KR.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/s8eMxEQWh7xT6Geh6i3QFX811KR.png","language":"en","width":4295,"height":325},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ywDXhrjoATcxY8lgQbkqTPS27qP.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ywDXhrjoATcxY8lgQbkqTPS27qP.png","language":"en","width":4318,"height":444},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xi1BsgID9tUOAk83pNdkyAnRfYK.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xi1BsgID9tUOAk83pNdkyAnRfYK.png","language":"en","width":1276,"height":133}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/im4QIPeNyH7K